      "value": "@{5b83e4ecbf31801631aa98b6|full_name}: Now that the comparison has been made, it's natural to like or dislike it.\nI don't think the old sound is adequate. I don't think the old sound is appropriate, because the current sound is more camera-like.\n比較対象が出来たんだから好き嫌いが出るのは自然でしょう。\n以前の音が適切かというと、わたしはそう思いません。今の音の方がよりカメラらしい音なので。",
